{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"阿摩司书","commonName":"阿摩司书","title":"阿摩司书","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"aea65afe0e5862ee36486d1d8f71c20a1bc4c3aa5415828aa0c58b4c80057d03","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["预言以色列的毁灭"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"在锡安生活安逸舒适的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在撒玛利亚山上自觉无忧的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们是列国之首以色列的显要，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人都仰望你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们去甲尼看看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然后从那里到哈玛大城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再到非利士人的迦特看看。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们比这些国家更好吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的领土不比你们的更广阔吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们以为灾难的日子离得还远，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就大肆施行暴政。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们躺在象牙床上，闲靠在卧榻上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们吃养在圈里的肥嫩牛羊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们伴着琴声唱慵懒的歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像大卫一样为自己制造乐器。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们以大碗狂饮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用上等膏油抹身，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却漠不关心约瑟家的衰亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，你们要首先被掳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的宴乐将从此消逝！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之上帝——主耶和华凭自己起誓说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我憎恶雅各的骄傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"厌弃他的城堡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把城和城中的一切都交给敌人。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["那时，如果一栋房子里剩下十人，这十人也要死亡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["亲属抬出尸体焚烧时，必问内屋的人：“你那里还有别人吗？”那人必回答：“没有。”问的人必说：“不要作声，我们不可提耶和华的名。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"看啊，耶和华一声令下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大屋顿成瓦砾，小房化为碎片。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"马能在悬崖上奔驰吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牛能在海中耕作吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们却使公正沦为毒药，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使公义之果变成苦艾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们炫耀自己征服了罗底巴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吹嘘凭自己的能力夺取了加宁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之上帝耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“以色列家啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使一个国家兴起攻击你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从哈马口直至亚拉巴河，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要到处欺压你们。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/AMO/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}